    "Name": "Phantom",
    "Details": "The Phantom is intended to push a medium recon 'Mech to its most extreme limits. The Phantom is built on a lightweight Endo Steel chassis and is propelled to a top speed of 151.2 km/h by a 360 XL Engine. The Phantom has good protection for its size with six tons of Ferro-Fibrous armor. In its primary configuration the Phantom is an electronics marvel. To root out hidden units, the Phantom carries an Active Probe. The Phantom prime has an ECM Suite for protection from enemy electronic warfare systems. To engage its enemies at long range, the Phantom has an LRM-5 launcher backed up by an ER Medium Laser and an ER Small Laser for close combat.",
